    "reads": {
      "front": "From behind the caster: a glowing field on the ground ahead, a red sky and meteors dropping in one after another from high on the far side, each bursting into sparks and rock on a different spot.",
      "side": "The best read of the falls: diagonal streaks from the top of the frame to scattered landing points, smoke trails hanging in the air, a dark cloud deck overhead.",
